      "result": "Contrary dependency: preferred intact H or discrete fastening is necessary for retention. J03/J06/J07 support detached-component conjunctions; J11 makes grammar soft. Contrary prediction: ending retention completes recovery. Withdrawal/unroute completes at 8, but V removal/M lifting still completes at 9. Neither detach, assembly nor measure creates retention. No axiom contradiction. Actual unresolved tension: S/V and M/L require six actions including optional restoration and displace H, while conventional C gives the same stipulated service with two actions and zero impacts. Their distinct component occupancy supports diversity, not superiority. AM/AI cannot establish Q=4, wear, elastic benefit or durable operation.",
